================================================================================
1. sft/
================================================================================

Derived from ScaleCUA
  https://github.com/OpenGVLab/ScaleCUA                    Apache-2.0
which in turn is derived from the Qwen2.5-VL fine-tuning code
  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen2.5-VL (now QwenLM/Qwen3-VL) Apache-2.0

sft/qwenvl/train/train_qwen.py is adapted from FastChat
  https://github.com/lm-sys/FastChat                       Apache-2.0
  (original copyright notice retained at the top of the file)

sft/qwenvl/data/conversation.py (chat templates) is taken from ScaleCUA's
agent-sft/internvl_chat/internvl/conversation.py, which comes from InternVL
  https://github.com/OpenGVLab/InternVL                    MIT
  Copyright (c) 2023 OpenGVLab  -- license text reproduced below.
and was originally derived from FastChat (Apache-2.0). We added templates to it.

Relative to ScaleCUA agent-sft/, these files are modified:
  sft/qwenvl/data/conversation.py  (from internvl_chat/internvl/)
and relative to ScaleCUA agent-sft/qwen-vl-finetune/, these:
  sft/qwenvl/data/data_qwen.py  sft/qwenvl/data/rope2d.py
  sft/qwenvl/train/argument.py  sft/qwenvl/train/train_qwen.py  sft/qwenvl/train/trainer.py
  sft/scripts/zero3.json  sft/requirements.txt
and these are added:
  sft/scripts/sft_local.sh  sft/scripts/sft_8b_slurm.sbatch
  sft/recipes/  sft/configs/  sft/requirements.lock.txt


